      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARCADIAN SASSY (2) could manage only fourth at this track last time but turned heads when posting a handy 19.41 over 340m at Hobart the start prior. Rates on top and can find winning form again. BUCKLE UP ALLIE (1) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Finished in the minors last time when second (30.27) at this track making it back to back placings. Form here sound including three wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Will give a great sight again. JORJI'S JAZZ (7) turned in a solid run last start over 340m at Hobart finishing 5th and beaten only 4 lengths (19.85). Worth another chance. BROMPTON (3) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
